OL,3,GNEWSAPolice step up Halloween and
OL,4,ABonfire Night patrols
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice will be stepping up patrols of
OL,7,Ftown centres and events during
OL,8,FHalloween and Bonfire Night to tackle
OL,9,Frobbery, burglary, theft and
OL,10,Fshoplifting.
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Police says the
OL,13,Foperation comes as "evenings become
OL,14,Fdarker and towns and neighbourhoods
OL,15,Fbecome busier with seasonal events".
OL,17,FDet Insp Hayley Thurston hoped everyone
OL,18,Fwould enjoy the season, but urged
OL,19,Fpeople to remain "alert" and take
OL,20,F"simple precautions to protect
OL,21,Fthemselves and their property".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
